WEBVTT

00:12:58.232 --> 00:13:02.101
is that the very ingredients
that nurture love --

00:13:02.125 --> 00:13:04.550
mutuality, reciprocity,

00:13:04.574 --> 00:13:08.311
protection, worry,
responsibility for the other --

00:13:08.335 --> 00:13:11.755
are sometimes the very ingredients
that stifle desire.

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:16.498
Because desire comes
with a host of feelings

00:13:16.522 --> 00:13:20.376
that are not always
such favorites of love:

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.169
jealousy, possessiveness,

00:13:22.193 --> 00:13:24.741
aggression, power, dominance,

00:13:24.765 --> 00:13:26.519
naughtiness, mischief.

00:13:26.543 --> 00:13:30.831
Basically most of us will get turned on
at night by the very same things